<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Catálogo de Productos</title>
	<style>
		:root {
			--primary-color: #2c3e50;
			--accent-color: #e74c3c;
			--bg-color: #f8f9fa;
		}
		body {
			font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
			margin: 0;
			padding: 0;
			background-color: var(--bg-color);
			color: #333;
		}
		header {
			background-color: var(--primary-color);
			color: white;
			text-align: center;
			padding: 2rem 1rem;
		}
		header h1 {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: 2.2rem;
		}
		header p {
			margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
			color: #bdc3c7;
		}
		.container {
			max-width: 1200px;
			margin: 2rem auto;
			padding: 0 1rem;
		}
		.search-box {
			text-align: center;
			margin-bottom: 2rem;
		}
		.search-box input {
			width: 100%;
			max-width: 400px;
			padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
			font-size: 1rem;
			border: 1px solid #ccc;
			border-radius: 25px;
			outline: none;
			box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
		}
		.grid {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
			gap: 2rem;
		}
		.card {
			background: white;
			border-radius: 10px;
			overflow: hidden;
			box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
			transition: transform 0.3s ease;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
		}
		.card:hover {
			transform: translateY(-5px);
		}
		.card img {
			width: 100%;
			height: 200px;
			object-fit: cover;
			background-color: #eee;
		}
		.card-content {
			padding: 1.5rem;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			flex-grow: 1;
		}
		.card-title {
			font-size: 1.25rem;
			margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
			color: var(--primary-color);
		}
		.card-description {
			font-size: 0.95rem;
			color: #666;
			margin-bottom: 1rem;
			flex-grow: 1;
		}
		.card-footer {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: space-between;
			align-items: center;
			margin-top: auto;
		}
		.price {
			font-size: 1.2rem;
			font-weight: bold;
			color: var(--accent-color);
		}
		.btn-whatsapp {
			background-color: #25d366;
			color: white;
			padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
			border-radius: 5px;
			text-decoration: none;
			font-weight: bold;
			font-size: 0.9rem;
			transition: background 0.2s;
		}
		.btn-whatsapp:hover {
			background-color: #1ebe5d;
		}
		footer {
			text-align: center;
			padding: 2rem;
			background-color: #2c3e50;
			color: white;
			margin-top: 3rem;
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<header>
		<h1>Mi Catálogo de Productos</h1>
		<p>Encuentra lo que buscas al mejor precio</p>
	</header>

	<div class="container">
		<div class="search-box">
			<input type="text" id="searchInput" placeholder="Buscar productos..." onkeyup="filterProducts()">
		</div>

		<div class="grid" id="productGrid">
			<div class="card" data-name="perfume esika">
				<img src="img/producto1.jpg" alt="Perfume Ésika">
				<div class="card-content">
					<h3 class="card-title">Perfume Ésika Pulso</h3>
					<p class="card-description">Fragancia masculina de alta duración con notas maderosas.</p>
					<div class="card-footer">
						<span class="price">$25.00</span>
						<a href="https://wa.me/593900000000?text=Hola,%20estoy%20interesado%20en%20el%20Perfume%20Ésika%20Pulso" class="btn-whatsapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pedir por WhatsApp</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="card" data-name="power bank anker">
				<img src="img/producto2.jpg" alt="Power Bank Anker">
				<div class="card-content">
					<h3 class="card-title">Power Bank Anker 20000mAh</h3>
					<p class="card-description">Carga rápida portátil ideal para mantener tus dispositivos encendidos todo el día.</p>
					<div class="card-footer">
						<span class="price">$35.00</span>
						<a href="https://wa.me/593982543871?text=Hola,%20estoy%20interesado%20en%20el%20Power%20Bank%20Anker" class="btn-whatsapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pedir por WhatsApp</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="card" data-name="set cosmeticos cyzone">
				<img src="img/producto3.jpg" alt="Set de Maquillaje">
				<div class="card-content">
					<h3 class="card-title">Set de Maquillaje Cyzone</h3>
					<p class="card-description">Incluye labial mate, máscara de pestañas y delineador de larga duración.</p>
					<div class="card-footer">
						<span class="price">$18.00</span>
						<a href="https://wa.me/593900000000?text=Hola,%20estoy%20interesado%20en%20el%20Set%20de%20Maquillaje%20Cyzone" class="btn-whatsapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pedir por WhatsApp</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<footer>
		<p>&copy; 2026 Mi Negocio. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
	</footer>

	<script>
		function filterProducts() {
			const input = document.getElementById('searchInput').value.toLowerCase();
			const cards = document.getElementsByClassName('card');

			for (let i = 0; i < cards.length; i++) {
				const name = cards[i].getAttribute('data-name');
				cards[i].style.display = name.includes(input) ? '' : 'none';
			}
		}
	</script>
</body>
</html>
